cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StatsCapybara in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "StatsCapybara: a free, interactive statistics course for visual learners"
abstract: >-
  An open, browser-based statistics curriculum of 105 interactive lessons
  across eight courses in two tracks, alongside 21 tool pages, seven long-form
  guides, 100 worked practice problems and ten practice datasets.
  Every lesson pairs a written explanation with a canvas visualization the
  reader can manipulate. The site is a dependency-free static build, and an
  automated test suite checks its statistical routines against published
  values.
type: software
